    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18331" root="زهم" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَهَمٌ</span></b>  The <i>fetid odour of corpses</i> or <i>carcases.</i>
(TA. [See also 1, first sentence; and the last explanation of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُهْمٌ</span>; and see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُهُومَةٌ</span>.]) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And The
<i>remains of fat in a horse</i> or <i>similar beast</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى دَابَّةٍ</span>).
(TA.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُهْمٌ</span>.

